### GET ValidationRules
GET {{host}}/admin/ValidationRules?$top=5
Authorization: {{authAdmin}}

### POST ValidationRules - sample 1
POST {{host}}/admin/ValidationRules
Authorization: {{authAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ruleCode": "R001",
  "ruleName": "PO Rate Match",
  "ruleCategory": "RATE_TOLERANCE",
  "toleranceType": "PERCENT",
  "toleranceValue": 5.0,
  "severity": "CRITICAL",
  "autoRejectFlag": false,
  "ruleVersion": 1,
  "active": true
}

### POST ValidationRules - sample 2
