Authorization: {{authAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ruleCode": "R005",
  "ruleName": "Quantity Tolerance",
  "ruleCategory": "QTY_TOLERANCE",
  "toleranceType": "PERCENT",
  "toleranceValue": 2.0,
  "severity": "WARNING",
  "autoRejectFlag": false,
  "ruleVersion": 1,
  "active": true
}

### POST ValidationRules - sample 3
POST {{host}}/admin/ValidationRules
Authorization: {{authAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

