GET {{host}}/processing/InvoiceHeaders?$top=5
Authorization: {{authSystem}}

### PendingExtractions is @readonly - POST always returns 405
### GET PendingExtractions
GET {{host}}/processing/PendingExtractions?$top=5
Authorization: {{authSystem}}

### ValidationRuns is @readonly - POST always returns 405
### GET ValidationRuns
GET {{host}}/processing/ValidationRuns?$top=5
Authorization: {{authSystem}}

### ReadyToPayQueue is @readonly - POST always returns 405
### GET ReadyToPayQueue
GET {{host}}/processing/ReadyToPayQueue?$top=5
Authorization: {{authSystem}}

######################################################################
# ProcessingService actions (unbound) - the only writable operations here
######################################################################

### Poll mailbox
POST {{host}}/processing/pollMailbox
Authorization: {{authSystem}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Run extraction for a document
POST {{host}}/processing/runExtraction
Authorization: {{authSystem}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111"
}

### Run validation for an invoice
POST {{host}}/processing/runValidation
Authorization: {{authSystem}}
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "invoiceId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111"
}
### Post invoice to ledger/ERP
POST {{host}}/processing/postToLedgerOrErp
Authorization: {{authSystem}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoiceId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111"
}